.TH OCCAM 1
.SH NAME
Occam \- Occam: Dependency\-Aware SQL Test Case Minimizer
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBoccam\fR [OPTIONS] <INPUT.sql>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Occam: Dependency\-Aware SQL Test Case Minimizer
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-oracle\fR \fI<COMMAND>\fR
Interestingness predicate command (SQL on stdin; exit 0 accepts)
.TP
\fB\-o, \-\-out\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Directory where reduced artifacts will be written, or '\-' for stdout
.RS
\fIDefault: \fRoccam\-out
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-reset\fR \fI<COMMAND>\fR
Lightweight state reset command (e.g. dropdb/createdb)
.TP
\fB\-\-timeout\fR \fI<SECONDS>\fR
Per\-execution timeout in seconds
.RS
\fIDefault: \fR10.0
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-log\-level\fR \fI<LEVEL>\fR
Log severity level
.RS
\fIDefault: \fRinfo
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-log\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR
Log output format
.RS
\fIDefault: \fRtext
.RE
.TP
\fB\-v, \-\-verbose\fR
Enable verbose debug output (equivalent to \-\-log\-level debug)
.TP
\fB\-q, \-\-quiet\fR
Suppress info logs and banners (equivalent to \-\-log\-level error)
.TP
\fB\-\-budget\fR \fI<SECONDS>\fR
Shared wall\-clock cap including initial check, reduction, and audit
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-oracle\-executions\fR \fI<N>\fR
Maximum uncached oracle attempts including initial check and validation
.TP
\fB\-\-slicing\fR
Enable dependency slicing
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-slicing\fR
Disable dependency slicing
.TP
\fB\-\-closure\fR
Enable dependency closure
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-closure\fR
Disable dependency closure
.TP
\fB\-\-intra\-statement\fR
Enable intra\-statement reductions
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-intra\-statement\fR
Disable intra\-statement reductions
.TP
\fB\-\-unrestricted\fR
Enable unrestricted reductions
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-unrestricted\fR
Disable unrestricted reductions
.TP
\fB\-\-cache\fR
Enable candidate caching
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-cache\fR
Disable candidate caching
.TP
\fB\-\-dialect\fR \fI<DIALECT>\fR
SQL dependency dialect
.RS
\fIDefault: \fRgeneric
.RE
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\fB<INPUT.sql>\fR
Path to fuzz SQL input, or '\-' for stdin
